msgstr "Jei padaryta teisingai, vartotojas pamatys, kad jūsų programa nori prieiti prie jų %(site)s paskyros, ir bus paraginta patvirtinti arba atmesti užklausą."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "If everything is good, we will respond with the following (example) JSON body:"
msgstr "Jei viskas gerai, mes atsakysime šiuo (pavyzdžiu) JSON kūnu:"

#. keep the code between backticks exactly as it is
#, machine, plain1
msgid "If the submitted link has a `Content-Type: image/*` header, the link itself is used as the thumbnail asset."
msgstr "Jei pateikta nuoroda turi `Content-Type: image/*` antraštę, pati nuoroda naudojama kaip miniatiūrų turtas."

#. keep the code between backticks exactly as it is
#, machine, plain1
msgid "If the submitted link has a `Content-Type: text/html` header, and no thumbnail meta element is found, the `src` attribute of the first `img` element will be scraped and used as the thumbnail."
msgstr "Jei pateikta nuoroda turi `Content-Type: text/html` antraštę ir nerandama miniatiūrų meta elemento, pirmojo `img` `src` atributas elementas bus nugramzdintas ir naudojamas kaip miniatiūra."

#. keep the code between backticks exactly as it is
